person let alone through a computer screen.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was rude of me, I apologize.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Discord: HalfTangible#7505<br /> &quot;+3 Girlfriend is totally unoptimized. You are better off with a +1 Keen Witty girlfriend and then appling Greater Magic Make-up to increase her enhancement bonus.&quot; -Keld Danar on <a href=\"https://forums.giantitp.com/showthread.php?p=10856903#post10856903\" target=\"_blank\">GitP Forums</a><br /> Playing Peleps Raptor, Fire Aspect playboy in the Grand Tour","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/879-halftangible","name":"HalfTangible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T05:45:25-07:00","id":652342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/649014-why-would-a-db-of-the-realm-join-a-group-of-anathema?p=649511#post649511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's not really enforced much by the Order, though. At least not in any meaningful ways. Like if a dynast publicly flays a peasant alive the Order's gonna cluck it's tongue and shake it's head and condemn it, but they're probably not going to send a bunch of monks to go Kung-fu fight the guy for his excesses. If they were killing whole towns then yeah they totally would, but that's more in the interest of keeping the empire sound. It's like the Templar you always see in stories about the crusades who get that pre-forgiveness crap that absolves the, from present and future sins during the battle and subsequent sacking of the city.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not quite sure of that. The Immaculate Order spreads the belief that Dragonbloods are enlightened beings, so it wants them to act like enlightened beings, and I imagine 99% of the monks actually believe in what they preach. I would expect that someone who really goes out of their way to abuse their station will eventually have a very object lesson from few Immaculates on the topic of how a Prince of the Earth should behave - not just because of the bad PR, but because they violate the Immaculate faith.<br /> <br /> I expect that quite a few Dynasts may switch over when faced with a charismatic and persuasive Anathema. Many of the more idealistic DBs probably do not appreciate the state of the Realm, and a Solar or even a Lunar can persuade them to change sides if they show through their deeds that they are not a puppet of foul demons and instead champion the causes the DB believes in. There are also quite a few ways a Dynast can find out the immaculate version of history is not correct, especially if the Dynast has an interest in the occult and the divine. Heck, most celestial gods have no love for the Dragonblooded - iirc the Yu-Shan book mentioned that many hold them even lower than non-exalted mortals, as the latter <b>could</b> become exalted of the Incarna. It is a small miracle that the Sidereals and the Immaculates have managed to muzzle them so far, but I imagine more than a few DBs have gotten the hint that things are not as they were told.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3332,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","user":"4uk4ata","date":". 09-05-2015, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3332-4uk4ata","name":"4uk4ata","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T06:06:10-07:00","id":652374,"title":"","content":"Many Dragonblood sorcerers know that things are not what the orthodox version of the faith says. They know they've been trained by Sidereals. They've read First Age texts. They may even know that Anathema are not literally demons. But that doesn't necessarily mean they believe the Immaculate Order is wrong, just that it's metaphorical. Or they may see it as a necessary myth.<br /> <br /> Or not. There probably are Dragonblood who think the whole thing's rubbish, and I'm not saying your idea couldn't be used for the OP, I just don't think it's going to happen very much in the setting generally. It's just that the majority of Dragonblood who realise the Immaculate Philosophy isn't really true, aren't going to switch sides and join the Solars. After all, the Bronze Faction absolutely knows the whole thing is rubbish, but they still want to kill every Solar and Lunar out there, and consider themselves to have legitimate reasons to do so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 09-05-2015, 09:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T06:16:56-07:00","id":652383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/649014-why-would-a-db-of-the-realm-join-a-group-of-anathema?p=652374#post652374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Many Dragonblood sorcerers know that things are not what the orthodox version of the faith says. They know they've been trained by Sidereals.</div> </div> </div> </div>u wot m8<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T06:24:30-07:00","id":652386,"title":"","content":"In some books, the top students from the Heptagram know they've been taught by a mysterious form of Exalt who help the Realm fight Anathema. They also have to swear, under Corrupted Words, to not reveal this.<br /> In other books the Sidereals wear stupid masks and the Dragonblood students are very suspicious, but... do nothing whatsoever about it.<br /> <br /> In 1st edition, the unorthodox views of sorcerers was more of a thing than in 2nd ed, where views of the Immaculate Philosophy were much more literal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T06:27:04-07:00","id":652412,"title":"","content":"Oh, and Mnemon absolutely knows about Sidereals, which is why Kejak doesn't want her on the throne.<br /> <br /> This does not make her want to join up with the Solars.<br /> Then we have House Ledaal, many of whose leaders regularly coordinate with Sidereals.<br /> <br /> Actually, a fair few DBs know about them, and are brought into the conspiracy. Or knocked off if they won't cooperate, but they generally do.<br /> <br /> Read Caste Book: Air. Ledaal Kes has a section on Sidereals, which he refers to as the &quot;Five-Score Fellowship.&quot; He talks about how they are much better at understanding the true purpose of the Realm, and are much more patriotic, than most Dragonblood. He also thinks its a little silly they are so secretive, and thinks they should take their place in the Celestial Hierarchy.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 09-05-2015, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T06:58:57-07:00","id":652434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/649014-why-would-a-db-of-the-realm-join-a-group-of-anathema?p=652412#post652412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, and Mnemon absolutely knows about Sidereals, which is why Kejak doesn't want her on the throne.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought he didn't want her on the throne because she would be an absolute disaster. The same reason nobody else wants her on the throne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 09-05-2015, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T07:08:16-07:00","id":652437,"title":"","content":"That too. Of course, that's a little contradictory when many others also know about Sidereals too... but I guess he sees her as a threat in ways that others are not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T07:25:38-07:00","id":652456,"title":"","content":"Yeah that is all more than a little bit ridiculous. And I think most accessible ancient sorcerous times would have been heavily censored millennia ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T07:35:58-07:00","id":652464,"title":"","content":"They are heavily censored - for patricians. At the Heptagram, Dragonblood who've been properly vetted can read what few originals are left. The issue of course, being that they might be full of Solar Linguistics charms.<br /> It is a bit ridiculous. DBs know there are Sidereals, and just... go along with it?<br /> In our DB game, we found out about them and decided they needed to be taken out... and were rather shocked when it turned out the party's sorcerers already knew about them.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, whenever the books have explained about how the mysterious and secretive master trainers at the Heptagram and Cloister use powers DBs can't... it's also kind of stupid. Surely the DBs would be suspicious.<br /> <br /> And even if they were using Terrestrial Sorcery and CMA only... they can't use DB charms, and while getting a DB anima is possible, it's awkward and requires SMA.<br /> <br /> Honestly, I think it would be better if they just ran and had influence at these places, rather than worked as trainers. Especially when you consider how overworked they are. Kejak impersonating a secretary works fine. Sidereals dictating the destinies of senior House Ledaal members? That's asking to have the whole thing blown open.<br /> Or had charms that made people watching ignore the obvious signs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 09-05-2015, 10:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T08:00:50-07:00","id":652509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/649014-why-would-a-db-of-the-realm-join-a-group-of-anathema?p=652464#post652464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And even if they were using Terrestrial Sorcery and CMA only... they can't use DB charms, and while getting a DB anima is possible, it's awkward and requires SMA.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well there is a spell that does it too. Disguise of the New Face.<br /> <br /> But yeah, I'd think DB sorcerers sometimes want to have influence at the Heptagram, how are they going to react after noticing that for hundreds of years no known graduate has ever gotten a top position?<br /> <br /> The Sidereals shouldn't just have outright total control over the Heptagram, or the Mouth of Peace. They're a sinister conspiracy but they should also struggle against DBs who control than they want to give up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T08:12:51-07:00","id":652560,"title":"","content":"Disguise of the New Face allows an awareness roll to see through it though.<br /> <br /> Ragara Bhagwei is in char\u200bge of the Heptagram, so DBs do rise in the ranks, it's just that a lot of the top people are Sidereals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T08:46:46-07:00","id":652643,"title":"","content":"I had my dynast stumble into heaven itself during the Carnival of Meeting and get stranded there for a few months.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T09:20:20-07:00","id":652688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/649014-why-would-a-db